WEBVTT

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:20.854
<i>This is a story passed down</i>
<i>through the ages.</i>

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:26.109
<i>A legend of destruction brought on</i>
<i>by the horrible deeds of humankind.</i>

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.069
<i>Four-hundred years ago,</i>

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:30.947
<i>humans were at the height</i>
<i>of their prosperity.</i>

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:36.119
<i>However, many of their hearts</i>
<i>were filled with deceit, hate, and doubt.</i>

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:40.081
<i>And like a rotten fruit</i>
<i>slowly decomposing,</i>

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.375
<i>humans sank into the darkness.</i>

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:45.420
<i>A darkness they created on their own.</i>

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:54.220
<i>Humans tried to use the power</i>
<i>of the darkness to correct their mistakes.</i>

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:57.140
<i>They wanted to erase war</i>
<i>from the face of the earth.</i>

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:02.353
<i>However, the darkness saw the true nature</i>
<i>of the world that people had built.</i>

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:07.025
I have been born from darkness.

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:18.870
<i>The time has come</i>
<i>to receive punishment for your sins.</i>

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:23.958
<i>The earth wishes to have a peaceful rest</i>

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:29.547
<i>away from your hate,</i>
<i>your doubt, your greed.</i>

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:32.801
<i>Away from all of your arrogance.</i>

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:41.726
<i>I must free the world</i>
<i>from the darkness you've brought upon it.</i>

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:46.606
<i>The darkness,</i>
<i>the power humans had created themselves,</i>

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:49.734
<i>brought their society</i>
<i>to the brink of destruction.</i>

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:52.695
<i>Before the world could be destroyed,</i>

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.115
<i>a giant pillar of light broke</i>
<i>through the earth</i>

00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:57.492
<i>and reached up to the heavens.</i>

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:02.497
<i>A creature emerged from the light.</i>

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.375
<i>It took on the look of a man</i>
<i>with a giant sword</i>

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:10.255
<i>mixed with a dragon with beautiful wings.</i>

00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:14.801
<i>The creature and the darkness realized</i>
<i>they were enemies.</i>

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.720
<i>It was as if they both knew</i>

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:20.431
<i>that it was their destiny</i>
<i>to fight each other.</i>

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:25.103
<i>The fierce battle shook the earth.</i>

00:02:25.728 --> 00:02:27.981
<i>Many of the continents were destroyed</i>,

00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:30.108
<i>sinking into the ocean.</i>

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:34.362
<i>Millions of people died.</i>

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:37.699
<i>However, it wasn't</i>
<i>until the dragon was victorious</i>

00:02:37.782 --> 00:02:40.034
<i>that the battle finally ended.</i>

00:02:41.119 --> 00:02:43.830
<i>Long after, this battle became a legend.</i>

00:02:43.913 --> 00:02:46.583
<i>The legend was passed down</i>
<i>through the ages.</i>

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:48.168
<i>And as time went on,</i>

00:02:48.251 --> 00:02:51.838
<i>the story morphed</i>
<i>into something different.</i>

00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:55.466
<i>We forgot the real legend.</i>

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:59.679
<i>The truth from a time long forgotten.</i>

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:17.530
400 YEARS LATER, CENTRAL METALLION
CONTINENT, KINGDOM OF META-LLICANA

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:32.295
Go forth, you demons,
creatures of chaos.

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:35.882
The Kingdom of Meta-llicana
will finally belong to me!

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:40.428
Stand your ground!

00:03:40.511 --> 00:03:42.597
If they get through us,
the castle is done for!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.350
They must have planned their attack

00:03:45.433 --> 00:03:48.770
for when the king, the knights,
and the Great Priest were all away.

00:03:56.444 --> 00:03:58.529
They've broken
through the gate!

00:03:58.613 --> 00:04:01.783
We can't let them advance
any further!

00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:03.701
Go, now! Go!

00:04:03.785 --> 00:04:04.994
Run them down!

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:07.080
Trample them to the ground!

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:12.043
THE ARRIVAL

00:04:12.126 --> 00:04:13.962
The enemy
has breached the castle!

00:04:14.545 --> 00:04:17.215
Gather all remaining soldiers
and head for the cathedral!

00:04:17.298 --> 00:04:20.551
We must protect
Princess Sheila Tuel Meta-llicana,

00:04:20.635 --> 00:04:21.844
no matter what!

00:04:24.555 --> 00:04:26.391
Princess Sheila.

00:04:26.474 --> 00:04:29.143
You'll be safe staying here
in the cathedral.

00:04:29.227 --> 00:04:31.187
Please continue to be patient.

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:33.523
I'll be fine. Who are these attackers?

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:39.320
These creatures are the followers
of the late evil wizard, Dark Schneider

00:04:39.404 --> 00:04:43.491
We know they call themselves
the Dark Rebel Army.

00:04:44.659 --> 00:04:46.452
The Dark Rebel Army?

00:04:49.414 --> 00:04:52.292
I'm scared! I'm so scared!

00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:55.420
Get off me, you brat! Let go!

00:04:56.754 --> 00:04:58.673
Come on, Lucien.

00:04:58.756 --> 00:05:00.591
Stop this. Why are you crying?

00:05:00.675 --> 00:05:02.885
I'm crying because I'm scared.

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:05.096
Oh, Yoko, let's just run away.

00:05:05.179 --> 00:05:08.641
It's okay, scaredy cat.
Enough with the tears.

00:05:09.726 --> 00:05:11.686
Come on. Wipe your face.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.896
Okay.

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:20.111
Oops! Now it's all dirty.

00:05:20.194 --> 00:05:21.404
I'll go wash it.

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:23.614
Don't worry. Just give it back.

00:05:23.698 --> 00:05:25.825
No. I'm gonna go wash it for you!

00:05:25.908 --> 00:05:27.702
Hold on! Just stay here.

00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:35.251
The enemy's force is strong.

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:39.047
It's only a matter of time
until they break through this door.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.298
Oh no.

00:05:40.381 --> 00:05:42.050
What's going on?

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:50.350
<i>I have to teach you a secret spell.</i>

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:53.811
<i>It has the power</i>
<i>to release a certain entity</i>

00:05:53.895 --> 00:05:56.773
<i>that has been sealed away</i>
<i>by a sacred power.</i>

00:05:57.315 --> 00:05:59.650
<i>A very dangerous power.</i>

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:03.237
Because of this,
you must never use this spell.

00:06:03.321 --> 00:06:07.909
It is only to be used as a last resort
to protect the kingdom when I'm gone.

00:06:09.118 --> 00:06:11.788
If you are forced to recite this spell,

00:06:11.871 --> 00:06:14.165
the seal on Lucien will be broken,

00:06:14.248 --> 00:06:16.667
and his second identity will awaken.

00:06:16.751 --> 00:06:18.753
What second identity?

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.214
What will happen to Lucien?

00:06:22.799 --> 00:06:27.595
Inside of him, I sealed the reincarnation
of the evil Dark Schneider.

00:06:28.262 --> 00:06:31.307
The wizard? You can't be serious.

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:38.898
When this powerful seal is broken,

00:06:38.981 --> 00:06:40.566
Dark Schneider will awaken

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:43.861
and use his magic
to defeat our enemies for us.

00:06:43.945 --> 00:06:48.783
However, in order to remove
this particularly strong seal spell,

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:53.287
he must receive a kiss
from a virgin maiden.

00:06:53.371 --> 00:06:54.205
Huh?

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:58.418
Therefore, Tia,
you will never be able to take a husband.

00:06:59.001 --> 00:07:01.129
You must remain pure.

00:07:01.963 --> 00:07:03.172
Wait. What?

00:07:03.756 --> 00:07:05.466
There's no way that's true.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.885
It's just a crazy legend, right?

00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:10.638
-I'll go wash your handkerchief.
-Uh, no, Lucien!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.392
Huh? It's you!

00:07:14.475 --> 00:07:15.768
So the little brat's back!

00:07:15.852 --> 00:07:19.230
You useless piece of trash!
Why the hell did you come back here?

00:07:21.107 --> 00:07:22.692
Uh…

00:07:22.775 --> 00:07:25.236
You better answer me.
Quit whining!

00:07:28.197 --> 00:07:31.242
Hey! Stop!
Please leave Lucien alone.

00:07:31.325 --> 00:07:33.536
And just who are you?

00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:37.331
My name is Tia Noto Yoko,
and I'm Lucien's guardian.

00:07:37.415 --> 00:07:39.792
Yoko?

00:07:39.876 --> 00:07:42.044
So you're the Great Priest's daughter.

00:07:44.672 --> 00:07:45.965
What is wrong with you?

00:07:46.048 --> 00:07:49.177
You can't just start crying and whining
every time someone threatens you.

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:51.512
I'm sorry, but I was really scared.

00:07:51.596 --> 00:07:53.389
Scaredy cat!

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:55.475
Why are you such a coward?
Aren't you a man?

00:07:55.558 --> 00:07:57.477
Doesn't it annoy you
when he looks down on you?

00:07:58.478 --> 00:07:59.312
Mm-mm.

00:08:00.771 --> 00:08:02.064
You're hopeless.

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:06.611
Wow. So messy.

00:08:09.238 --> 00:08:11.574
<i>Well, he is what he is.</i>

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:12.909
<i>It's not so bad.</i>

00:08:15.369 --> 00:08:17.371
They're too strong.

00:08:17.955 --> 00:08:19.540
It's all over for us.

00:08:20.917 --> 00:08:22.126
This is bad.

00:08:23.794 --> 00:08:26.047
I'm so scared!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:27.673
Just stay calm.

00:08:28.341 --> 00:08:31.135
<i>The truth is I'm scared too.</i>

00:08:32.053 --> 00:08:33.721
Tia Noto Yoko.

00:08:34.931 --> 00:08:36.182
Princess Sheila.

00:08:37.308 --> 00:08:38.142
Uh…

00:08:41.646 --> 00:08:46.275
Your father told me that he once sealed
a legendary wizard away.

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:50.321
He said he was so powerful
this wizard could protect us,

00:08:50.404 --> 00:08:53.115
and he would destroy all enemies
of our kingdom.

00:08:55.826 --> 00:08:57.453
Is that true, Madam Yoko?

00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:59.455
You must release this power.

00:08:59.539 --> 00:09:00.790
Please, Madam Yoko.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:02.959
Please, Madam Yoko!

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:05.336
Hmm?

00:09:07.004 --> 00:09:09.840
No! That spell is way too embarrassing!

00:09:09.924 --> 00:09:11.676
There's no way I can do it here. No way!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.095
-Huh?
-Embarrassing?

00:09:22.979 --> 00:09:26.649
I found you, Princess,
and now I'm going to kill you!

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:29.777
I won't let you hurt her.

00:09:32.989 --> 00:09:34.198
Lord Osborn!

00:09:34.282 --> 00:09:35.908
Hmm?

00:09:35.992 --> 00:09:37.660
You're going
to let us live, right?

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:40.079
Remember, you promised us
you would be okay.

00:09:40.162 --> 00:09:43.624
Besides, we gave you the information
to help you succeed today.

00:09:44.333 --> 00:09:45.710
They did what?

00:09:45.793 --> 00:09:47.420
All those men are traitors!

00:09:47.503 --> 00:09:51.048
As we said before,
we pledge our loyalty to you.

00:09:51.132 --> 00:09:53.509
Thanks so much.

00:09:56.095 --> 00:09:57.138
No!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.101
They're… they're giants!

00:10:02.184 --> 00:10:03.519
They're huge!

00:10:04.687 --> 00:10:08.107
Let's go! Kill all of them!

00:10:11.235 --> 00:10:14.155
I don't wanna die! I don't wanna die!

00:10:14.238 --> 00:10:17.241
He must receive a kiss
from a virgin maiden.

00:10:17.325 --> 00:10:21.203
No way! I don't wanna do it!
I can't! I won't!

00:10:21.287 --> 00:10:22.830
Why is this happening to me?

00:10:23.914 --> 00:10:26.208
Yoko, look out!

00:10:43.267 --> 00:10:44.268
Die, die, die!

00:10:52.151 --> 00:10:53.569
I know you're scared.

00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:54.654
I am too,

00:10:55.446 --> 00:10:57.156
but we have to…

00:10:58.824 --> 00:11:01.285
<i>It's my first time doing this, but…</i>

00:11:01.369 --> 00:11:02.370
<i>but…</i>

00:11:09.669 --> 00:11:10.795
Accept this.

00:11:13.047 --> 00:11:15.174
<i>In the name of Ino Mata,</i>

00:11:15.257 --> 00:11:17.593
<i>our beloved Goddess of beauty…</i>

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:26.602
<i>…please break now this seal.</i>

00:11:31.357 --> 00:11:32.525
Lucien!

00:11:33.317 --> 00:11:35.111
What's happening?

00:11:35.194 --> 00:11:36.445
I'm not sure.

00:11:36.529 --> 00:11:38.406
What's that?

00:11:38.489 --> 00:11:41.617
Where's this powerful,
evil aura coming from?

00:11:44.578 --> 00:11:46.789
<i>The seal on Lucien will be broken,</i>

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:49.125
<i>and his second identity will awaken.</i>

00:11:50.334 --> 00:11:55.339
<i>Inside of him, I sealed the reincarnation</i>
<i>of the evil Dark Schneider.</i>

00:12:09.061 --> 00:12:12.523
Well, looks like I finally return.

00:12:12.606 --> 00:12:14.859
Where's that Great Priest?

00:12:14.942 --> 00:12:18.112
That bastard sealed me away
inside of that baby,

00:12:18.696 --> 00:12:23.117
but I'm back,
thanks to a little reincarnation magic.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.286
So, his time has come.

00:12:25.369 --> 00:12:27.329
I'm here to destroy him!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.708
I don't know
what sort of game you're playing,

00:12:30.791 --> 00:12:32.376
but it's time for you to die!

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.462
Ogres!

00:12:35.546 --> 00:12:36.922
Just shut up!

00:12:37.006 --> 00:12:39.133
Damned!

00:12:42.261 --> 00:12:44.346
No way!

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:48.476
Only the strongest wizards are able
to use such powerful magic.

00:12:48.976 --> 00:12:50.811
Just who is this man?

00:12:52.688 --> 00:12:54.356
Uh, are you…

00:12:55.107 --> 00:12:56.817
are you still the same Lucien?

00:12:56.901 --> 00:13:00.070
Yeah. That's right. Hey, Yoko.

00:13:00.571 --> 00:13:03.115
The two of us grew up together, didn't we?

00:13:03.199 --> 00:13:05.701
And you're the one who awakened me.

00:13:11.248 --> 00:13:14.919
Wait. Did he just use
ancient regeneration magic?

00:13:15.002 --> 00:13:16.295
But how?

00:13:16.378 --> 00:13:18.047
No way.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.633
It can't be true that you're Lucien.

00:13:20.716 --> 00:13:23.552
You are just an ancient, evil wizard now.

00:13:23.636 --> 00:13:26.972
I'm the reincarnation of a dark wizard.

00:13:27.056 --> 00:13:31.060
They'd call me Dark Schneider,
but I'm also your friend Lucien.

00:13:31.143 --> 00:13:33.103
He's Dark Schneider?

00:13:33.729 --> 00:13:36.941
He started the Golem War 15 years ago.

00:13:37.024 --> 00:13:40.402
He overran
the entire Kingdom of Meta-llicana.

00:13:42.196 --> 00:13:44.990
Prince Lars of the Five Knights
and Dark Schneider

00:13:45.074 --> 00:13:46.450
had a fight to the death.

00:13:46.534 --> 00:13:47.910
As he was about to die,

00:13:47.993 --> 00:13:51.580
Dark Schneider used
the ancient art of reincarnation.

00:13:52.164 --> 00:13:55.042
My brother lost his life then,
fighting against him.

00:13:55.751 --> 00:13:58.420
This man, this dark wizard.

00:13:59.046 --> 00:14:00.756
I'm gonna need you to stand aside.

00:14:01.799 --> 00:14:05.803
And we need you
to hurry up and defeat these invaders.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.680
No, thanks.

00:14:07.763 --> 00:14:08.889
Huh?

00:14:08.973 --> 00:14:10.558
Hold on!

00:14:10.641 --> 00:14:14.979
Actually, I know Yoko here
wouldn't want to see Lucien get hurt.

00:14:15.563 --> 00:14:17.815
-She always treated us well.
-Uh…

00:14:17.898 --> 00:14:21.318
And for that, I'm going to let you live.

00:14:21.402 --> 00:14:23.529
But the rest of you here are going to die.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:29.451
I don't owe any of your people anything.

00:14:32.246 --> 00:14:33.414
Lucien!

00:14:33.497 --> 00:14:34.623
Stop it!

00:14:34.707 --> 00:14:36.876
You knock that crap off right now!

00:14:36.959 --> 00:14:39.628
You little mama's boy! Such a butt-face!

00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:41.589
So this is how you really are then?

00:14:41.672 --> 00:14:43.132
I thought you were nice.

00:14:43.215 --> 00:14:46.594
All right. Well, fine.
Don't talk to me ever again!

00:14:46.677 --> 00:14:50.472
We're not friends anymore,
and I won't ever stand up for you!

00:14:54.143 --> 00:14:55.769
Oh, please. What's that look?

00:14:55.853 --> 00:14:57.688
Are you going to disobey me?

00:14:59.648 --> 00:15:01.567
Well, what can it hurt.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:04.028
I guess maybe I do owe you one.

00:15:04.862 --> 00:15:07.239
Okay. Why not. I'll do it.

00:15:07.323 --> 00:15:09.074
Oh. How about that?

00:15:09.158 --> 00:15:11.410
You actually are Lucien, then.

00:15:11.493 --> 00:15:13.120
Amazing!

00:15:13.203 --> 00:15:15.414
Good luck!
I know you can do it!

00:15:17.833 --> 00:15:21.712
Hey! You two stop your blabbering
and listen to me!

00:15:21.795 --> 00:15:25.674
No one should have
to wait this long to destroy someone!

00:15:26.675 --> 00:15:29.428
How dare you
call yourself Dark Schneider!

00:15:29.511 --> 00:15:32.097
You're nothing like that legendary man!

00:15:32.181 --> 00:15:34.141
You're just an impersonator!

00:15:34.224 --> 00:15:38.729
Tonight begins a new era
for us, the Dark Rebel Army.

00:15:38.812 --> 00:15:39.772
Attack!

00:15:41.273 --> 00:15:46.904
Sukii, sula, sushu.

00:15:47.571 --> 00:15:49.365
Mega, megadea.

00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:51.700
You don't know what you're in for.

00:15:51.784 --> 00:15:53.661
You're just a bunch of fools.

00:15:53.744 --> 00:15:55.412
Don't underestimate me.

00:15:56.872 --> 00:15:58.290
Now, perish!

00:15:59.166 --> 00:16:00.000
Sodom!

00:16:07.716 --> 00:16:11.553
This… this is the power
of the dark wizard.

00:16:12.096 --> 00:16:15.057
He has… he has such frightful power!

00:16:20.604 --> 00:16:22.982
Looks like you're the last one standing.

00:16:25.442 --> 00:16:28.153
No. This isn't over!

00:16:28.237 --> 00:16:31.448
I am going to kill you,
you pathetic impostor!

00:16:31.532 --> 00:16:34.076
The Dark Rebel Army and I, Osborn,

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:36.161
have been appointed by the Great One!

00:16:36.245 --> 00:16:37.913
We will destroy this kingdom

00:16:37.997 --> 00:16:41.125
with the greatest power
you'll ever witness!

00:16:43.168 --> 00:16:45.087
The lightning.

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:48.757
It's everywhere,
striking all over the castle.

00:16:48.841 --> 00:16:50.759
Slayer, slayer!

00:16:50.843 --> 00:16:54.722
Balmor, oh lightning of the darkness!

00:16:55.305 --> 00:16:58.100
Wow. A little lightning spell?

00:16:59.768 --> 00:17:01.228
You fool!

00:17:01.311 --> 00:17:03.105
That won't work on me.

00:17:03.772 --> 00:17:07.317
Die, you fake wizard!

00:17:07.401 --> 00:17:08.819
Balbolt!

00:17:14.324 --> 00:17:16.827
What do you mean it won't work on you?

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:20.205
You're burnt to a crisp!

00:17:20.789 --> 00:17:21.790
Lucien.

00:17:22.624 --> 00:17:23.459
No.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.007
How's that?

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:32.509
How does it feel to get struck down?

00:17:32.593 --> 00:17:34.344
Well? Come on!

00:17:34.428 --> 00:17:36.263
Tell me how it feels to be burned.

00:17:36.346 --> 00:17:38.223
So nice and toasty, huh?

00:17:38.307 --> 00:17:39.975
Hey! I can't hear you!

00:17:40.559 --> 00:17:42.102
I'm sending you back to the kitchen

00:17:42.186 --> 00:17:44.855
because you're just a tad overcooked!

00:17:48.692 --> 00:17:49.943
How annoying.

00:17:53.113 --> 00:17:55.991
No way!

00:17:58.243 --> 00:17:59.661
-No way!
-Lucien?

00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:05.834
Son of a bitch!

00:18:05.918 --> 00:18:07.169
Who do you think you are

00:18:07.252 --> 00:18:11.298
scratching up my handsome face
with your crappy magic, huh?

00:18:11.882 --> 00:18:14.009
I'll destroy you!

00:18:15.844 --> 00:18:20.224
Zaazard, Zaazard, Schrono, Chronossk…

00:18:22.976 --> 00:18:24.436
No! Not that spell!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.314
O flames of Hell,
burning in the depths of darkness.

00:18:27.397 --> 00:18:29.691
No, no! Please!

00:18:29.775 --> 00:18:33.612
I beg you.
Don't kill me! I'll do anything.

00:18:34.947 --> 00:18:37.574
You'll be my sword and slay my enemies.

00:18:43.288 --> 00:18:44.248
Venom!

00:18:46.041 --> 00:18:47.876
No!

00:18:52.923 --> 00:18:55.050
I can't believe he actually did it.

00:18:55.134 --> 00:18:57.761
He did. We… we won!

00:18:58.512 --> 00:19:01.765
Princess Sheila, we're still alive.

00:19:01.849 --> 00:19:03.642
Yes, we are.

00:19:04.226 --> 00:19:05.853
<i>He has so much power.</i>

00:19:08.313 --> 00:19:09.940
<i>The ancient wizard,</i>

00:19:10.858 --> 00:19:12.734
<i>Dark Schneider?</i>

00:19:15.821 --> 00:19:18.198
Um, thank you for all your help.

00:19:18.282 --> 00:19:21.952
As the second princess
of the Kingdom of Meta-llicana,

00:19:22.035 --> 00:19:24.830
I, Shelia Tuel Meta-llicana,
would like--

00:19:25.664 --> 00:19:28.709
H-hey! Do not walk away
from Princess Sheila

00:19:28.792 --> 00:19:30.252
once she is speaking to you.

00:19:30.335 --> 00:19:32.671
Wha… what… what is this?

00:19:33.881 --> 00:19:35.632
Do you have something to say?

00:19:35.716 --> 00:19:37.009
Go ahead. Speak.

00:19:37.092 --> 00:19:38.218
Huh?

00:19:38.302 --> 00:19:40.929
Um, uh, well, um…

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:42.973
Uh, thank you so much.

00:19:43.765 --> 00:19:45.309
Is that all?

00:19:46.059 --> 00:19:47.603
Uh, well, I mean,

00:19:47.686 --> 00:19:50.314
now that the bad guys
have all been destroyed,

00:19:50.397 --> 00:19:53.317
should you change back
to Lucien, and then I…

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.777
Huh? Huh?

00:19:56.653 --> 00:19:58.614
Uh, where'd he go?

00:20:03.952 --> 00:20:04.953
Hey!

00:20:05.037 --> 00:20:08.165
Wait up! Where are you going?

00:20:08.248 --> 00:20:10.626
I do have other things to do, you know?

00:20:13.045 --> 00:20:14.379
What other things?

00:20:15.964 --> 00:20:18.717
All right. I guess you deserve to know.

00:20:21.845 --> 00:20:24.765
First thing,
I'm gonna get revenge on your father

00:20:24.848 --> 00:20:26.934
for sealing me away.

00:20:28.769 --> 00:20:29.645
<i>Next,</i>

00:20:29.728 --> 00:20:33.649
<i>I'm going to start a war</i>
<i>to conquer the entire world.</i>

00:20:35.359 --> 00:20:36.276
What do you think?

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.987
Doesn't that make your blood tingle
with excitement?

00:20:39.071 --> 00:20:41.448
Well, not really.

00:20:41.531 --> 00:20:45.244
And I plan to kill anyone
who stands in my way.

00:20:46.203 --> 00:20:48.413
I don't care if they're good or bad.

00:20:48.497 --> 00:20:50.499
A devil…

00:20:51.041 --> 00:20:52.251
But you?

00:20:52.334 --> 00:20:55.879
I'll spare you
just like I promised I would.

00:20:55.963 --> 00:21:00.634
<i>Why is my heart beating so fast</i>
<i>for a man like this?</i>

00:21:03.095 --> 00:21:04.554
<i>He must have…</i>

00:21:04.638 --> 00:21:06.515
<i>He put me under a spell.</i>

00:21:07.516 --> 00:21:09.101
N-no. It can't be.

00:21:09.184 --> 00:21:11.019
It's… it's magic, right?

00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:12.271
It is.

00:21:12.354 --> 00:21:14.690
You must have used a spell on me.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:16.441
You're horrible.

00:21:16.525 --> 00:21:18.485
I'm not using any magic.

00:21:19.945 --> 00:21:23.115
Lucien, so do you have feelings for me?

00:21:23.198 --> 00:21:24.157
No.

00:21:24.241 --> 00:21:27.452
I hate you and how you
always order me around all the time.

00:21:39.798 --> 00:21:41.341
What's wrong?

00:21:42.009 --> 00:21:43.343
What did you…

00:21:43.427 --> 00:21:44.803
What is this?

00:21:49.641 --> 00:21:50.475
Huh?

00:21:52.811 --> 00:21:54.771
Yoko, what is this?

00:21:55.272 --> 00:21:58.692
<i>Could it be the spell</i>
<i>to seal him away</i>

00:21:58.775 --> 00:22:00.902
<i>is also a virgin maiden's kiss?</i>

00:22:01.486 --> 00:22:04.323
Huh? Hang on.
Where are the monsters?

00:22:04.406 --> 00:22:05.282
Where'd they go?

00:22:06.658 --> 00:22:08.452
We chased them all away.

00:22:08.535 --> 00:22:11.079
Huh? Really? We did?

00:22:11.163 --> 00:22:12.998
Oh, good. That's so awesome.

00:22:13.081 --> 00:22:15.125
Mm-hmm. It is.

00:22:15.792 --> 00:22:17.794
Hey, Yoko. I'm kinda hungry.

00:22:17.878 --> 00:22:19.838
Okay. Let's head back.

00:22:19.921 --> 00:22:22.299
All right. Let's go.

00:22:25.093 --> 00:22:27.304
Hey, Lucien. Do you like me?

00:22:27.387 --> 00:22:28.972
Um,

00:22:29.056 --> 00:22:29.890
yes!

00:23:19.648 --> 00:23:21.858
CENTRAL METALLION CONTINENT,
KINGDOM Of JUDAS

00:23:21.942 --> 00:23:22.984
A message.

00:23:23.068 --> 00:23:25.278
During their invasion
of the castle of Meta-llicana,

00:23:25.362 --> 00:23:28.448
Osborn's army
has been completely wiped out.

00:23:28.532 --> 00:23:30.325
There must be some mistake.

00:23:31.243 --> 00:23:32.077
No.

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:34.996
It's reported
that the wizard who defeated Osborn

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:37.040
used the ancient Venom spell.

00:23:37.124 --> 00:23:38.583
It can't be.

00:23:39.167 --> 00:23:42.587
Venom disappeared
when Dark Schneider was defeated

00:23:43.088 --> 00:23:45.549
fifteen years ago.
